# 国内镜像：打包时 electron-builder 的二进制(winCodeSign / nsis / 7za)与 Electron 本体走 npmmirror，
# 避免从 GitHub releases 下载失败(EOF)。npm 会把下面的键暴露为 npm_config_* 环境变量，
# electron-builder(binDownload 读 npm_config_electron_builder_binaries_mirror) 与
# @electron/get(读 npm_config_electron_mirror) 均会自动采用，故 dist 脚本无需再写 cross-env。
electron_builder_binaries_mirror=https://registry.npmmirror.com/-/binary/electron-builder-binaries/
electron_mirror=https://registry.npmmirror.com/-/binary/electron/
